    "name": "Smart Factory Platform - API Smoke & Workflow Tests",
    "description": "API collection for the current Smart Factory source. Includes direct service requests, health diagnostics, and basic create/read/update/delete workflows. Run in order; create factory and machine before telemetry/simulator/maintenance/production. Requests may need adjustment if security or DTO validation changes. Health diagnostic tests deliberately accept 401/403/404/503 so inspect the response; these are not evidence of healthy services.",
